{"unit_id":"tag:0A2K:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003> 为有限局部自由（finite locally free）层（sheaves），取值于 <MATH_0004>-模（modules），具有正的秩（rank）。若存在同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0005>，作为 <MATH_0006>-代数（algebras），则存在可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）<MATH_0007>，在 <MATH_0008> 上，使得 <MATH_0009>，且这一同构（isomorphism）诱导给定的自同态（endomorphism）代数（algebras）的同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite locally free","target_term":"有限局部自由"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"rank","target_term":"秩"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"endomorphism","target_term":"自同态"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"finite locally free","target_term":"有限局部自由","context":"层的性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"代数用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"rank","target_term":"秩","context":"模的秩，待决定。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"同构关系，待决定。"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数","context":"代数用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆","context":"层的性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"endomorphism","target_term":"自同态","context":"自同态代数，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0A2K:proof","translation":"固定同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0001>。考虑层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>，它作为 <MATH_0003>-模（module）由局部同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0004> 生成（generated），使得由 <MATH_0005> 作共轭（conjugation）就是给定的自同态（endomorphism）代数（algebras）的同构（isomorphism）。局部计算（归约到 <MATH_0006> 和 <MATH_0007> 有限自由（finite free）且 <MATH_0008> 仿射（affine）的情形）表明 <MATH_0009> 可逆（invertible）。另一个局部计算表明赋值映射（evaluation map）<MATH_0010> 是同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"generated","target_term":"生成"},{"source_term":"conjugation","target_term":"共轭"},{"source_term":"endomorphism","target_term":"自同态"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆"},{"source_term":"evaluation map","target_term":"赋值映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"同构关系，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"代数用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"局部同构，待决定。"},{"source_term":"generated","target_term":"生成","context":"模的生成，待决定。"},{"source_term":"conjugation","target_term":"共轭","context":"自同态的共轭，待决定。"},{"source_term":"endomorphism","target_term":"自同态","context":"自同态代数，待决定。"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数","context":"代数用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由","context":"模的性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"概形性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆","context":"层的性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"evaluation map","target_term":"赋值映射","context":"层的求值操作，待决定。"}],"notes