{"unit_id":"tag:0A2L:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 Azumaya 代数（algebra），局部自由（locally free），在 <MATH_0004> 上的秩（rank）为 <MATH_0003>。则 <MATH_0005> 在 <MATH_0006> 的 Brauer 群（Brauer group）中的类（class）被 <MATH_0007> 零化（annihilated）。\n","allowed_english":["Azumaya","Brauer"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"locally free","target_term":"局部自由"},{"source_term":"rank","target_term":"秩"},{"source_term":"Brauer group","target_term":"Brauer 群"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"代数用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"locally free","target_term":"局部自由","context":"代数作为模的性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"rank","target_term":"秩","context":"代数的秩，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Brauer group","target_term":"Brauer 群","context":"群的类型，待决定。"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"Brauer 类，待决定。"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化","context":"群元素的零化，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0A2L:proof","translation":"选取平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0001>，并选取同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0002>，对于某些局部自由（locally free）<MATH_0003>-模（modules）<MATH_0004>，其秩（rank）为 <MATH_0005>。（可假设 <MATH_0006> 自由（free）。）考虑复合（composition）<MATH_0007>。第一个箭头（arrow）是通常的投影（projection），第二个箭头（arrow）是同构（isomorphism），将 <MATH_0008> 的最高外幂（top exterior power）对应于 <MATH_0009> 的截面（sections）的子模（submodule），这些截面在 <MATH_0010> 个字母的对称群（symmetric group）的作用（action）下按符号特征标（sign character）变换。于是 <MATH_0011>，且 <MATH_0012> 的秩（rank）为 <MATH_0013>。利用给定的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0014> 和典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0015>，可将 <MATH_0016> 看作截面（section），属于 <MATH_0017>，在 <MATH_0018> 上。我们断言 <MATH_0019>，作为 <MATH_0020> 的截面（sections）。具体地，应用引理 <REF_0001>，得到可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）<MATH_0021> 和典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0022>。利用这一同构（isomorphism），可见 <MATH_0023> 映到（maps）<MATH_0024>。由于 <MATH_0025> 是 <MATH_0026> 上的层（sheaf）（命题 <REF_0002>），得到典范（canonical）整体截面（global section）<MATH_0027>。局部计算表明 <MATH_0028> 是局部（locally）自由模（free module），秩（rank）为 <MATH_0029>，且由 <MATH_0030> 作（左）乘法（multiplication）诱导同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0031>。换言之，<MATH_0032> 是 <MATH_0033> 的 Brauer 群（Brauer group）中的平凡（trivial）元素（element），正如所需。\n","allowed_english":["Brauer"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"locally free","target_term":"局部自由"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"rank","target_term":"秩"},{"source_term":"free","target_term":"自由"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"top exterior power","target_term":"最高外幂"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"submodule","target_term":"子模"},{"source_term":"symmetric group","target_term":"对称群"},{"source_term"